#. ~ Description of "Kord AK rifle (Demilled)"
#. ~ Description of variant "Kord 6P67 rifle (Demilled)" of item "Kord AK rifle
#. (Demilled)"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A special forces Russian rifle chambered in 5.45 that someone has taken a "
"plasma cutter to, cutting it in three places to comply with import "
"restrictions.  This thing would have been hard to source, and thankfully its "
"unique complex recoil balance system remains intact, unlike the receiver and "
"barrel.  The telltale rainbow patterns of torch cuts mar the otherwise "
"beautiful receiver.  A well-equipped gunsmith with time and materials could "
"probably build a new one out of this…"
msgstr ""

